//@version=5
indicator("arguments/error_too_few_arguments")
// Fewer arguments than the builtin's required parameters is rejected before the
// script runs. `ta.sma` needs both `source` and `length`.

n = ta.sma(close)

// Expected error:
// error [too-few-arguments] 6:11: `ta.sma` requires at least 2 arguments, found 1
